{"id":"n17174-3-7","stage":1,"title":"입다 · 蒙受","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17174-3-7-1","ko":"생각보다 일을 빨리 끝내셨군요.","zh":"您完成工作的速度比预想的还要快啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"생각보다","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각보다","audio":"/audio/60c489add64a605ce212.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快。","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"끝내셨군요.","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝내다：结束，完成；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"끝내다","audio":"/audio/686f8e089bf22cd01d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29692","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝내셨군요","audio":"/audio/3d0fe8c940114f9b6cf6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"686f8e089bf22cd0","term":"끝내다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/686f8e089bf22cd01d10.mp3","entryId":"29692","definition":"做完事情。","pronunciation":["끈내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e20b49dae2848fb4b7d5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17174-3-7-2","ko":"네. 주민들의 도움을 입어 일을 잘 끝낼 수 있었습니다.","zh":"是的，多亏了居民们的帮助，我才能顺利完成任务。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"주민들의","meaning":"居民","explanation":"주민：居民；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"주민","audio":"/audio/fad44df7206bfa767dc2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25948","senseId":"1","lemma":"주민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주민들의","audio":"/audio/0649037dc14992183b23.mp3"}},{"text":"도움을","meaning":"帮助，帮忙，援助","explanation":"도움：帮助，帮忙，援助；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"도움","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64542","senseId":"1","lemma":"도움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도움을","audio":"/audio/8fbb1609fac99bfe542f.mp3"}},{"text":"입어","meaning":"蒙受","explanation":"입다：蒙受；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"3","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입어","audio":"/audio/adb17795588ce713306d.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","ex